.agents/skills/classification-skill/scripts/.sessions/

# Docs (local audits/plans); README-cited files stay tracked
docs/*
!docs/GO_LIVE.md
!docs/agent-eval-report.md

# Test & smoke artifacts
*/scripts/test_artifacts/*.monitoring.json
*/scripts/test_artifacts/*.reference.csv
*/scripts/test_artifacts/*.sha256.json
